WEBVTT

00:01.210 --> 00:03.400
Today's Orchestra...

00:06.250 --> 00:10.470
Figures from districts that weren't
supposed to be measured were included...

00:16.750 --> 00:20.580
Wait... Is it because we
flew around as we danced?

00:20.580 --> 00:24.160
How are we supposed to know
where the district ends?

00:24.160 --> 00:26.790
The measurement of mana
from the target district...

00:28.330 --> 00:29.910
...was 67%...

00:32.000 --> 00:34.950
We're going to be expelled.

00:38.320 --> 00:43.650
I kept drawing rainbow colours over and over

00:38.320 --> 00:43.650
hitasura kaiteta niji no iro

00:43.650 --> 00:48.150
Seven colours are not enough

00:43.650 --> 00:48.150
mou nanairo ja tarinai kara

00:48.150 --> 00:53.820
Everyday leaps over the "usual" and enters a new chapter

00:48.150 --> 00:51.150
mainichi wa sude ni itsumo wo

00:51.150 --> 00:53.820
tobikoete shinshou nano sa

00:53.820 --> 00:59.820
The story is going beyond

00:53.820 --> 00:59.820
monogatari wa haruka kanata e

01:03.990 --> 01:09.320
The bell toll in my heart

01:03.990 --> 01:09.320
kokoro de naridasu kane no ne ga

01:09.320 --> 01:13.650
is getting louder bit by bit

01:09.320 --> 01:13.650
sukoshi zutsu ookiku natte yuku

01:13.650 --> 01:17.150
Believe in the excitement

01:13.650 --> 01:17.150
sono takanari wo shinjite

01:17.150 --> 01:19.650
And take one step forward

01:17.150 --> 01:19.650
ippo wo fumidaseta nara

01:19.650 --> 01:26.980
It'll give me more power than I ever imagined

01:19.650 --> 01:26.980
souzou ijouno chikara ni kawatteru yo

01:25.320 --> 01:27.980
Can't be for sure

01:25.320 --> 01:27.980
zettai nante nai

01:26.980 --> 01:29.650
Nothing

01:26.980 --> 01:29.650
nanimo

01:27.980 --> 01:30.650
There's no guarantee

01:27.980 --> 01:30.650
kakushin wa dekinai

01:29.650 --> 01:32.320
No one

01:29.650 --> 01:32.320
daremo

01:30.650 --> 01:33.320
But I won't give up

01:30.650 --> 01:33.320
demo akiramenai

01:32.320 --> 01:34.980
That's why

01:32.320 --> 01:34.980
dakara

01:33.320 --> 01:35.480
I can still move forward

01:33.320 --> 01:35.480
susundeku koto ga

01:35.310 --> 01:36.820
I can still move forward

01:35.310 --> 01:36.820
dekiru yo

01:36.820 --> 01:42.650
Because there's magic right in here

01:36.820 --> 01:42.650
koko ni wa mahou ga aru kara

01:42.650 --> 01:48.980
It started to be brighter than the stars

01:42.650 --> 01:48.980
datte hoshi yori kagayaki dashita no ni

01:48.980 --> 01:53.650
I can't stop now

01:48.980 --> 01:53.650
tachidomareru hazu mo nai kara

01:53.650 --> 01:59.320
It entered into a new era

01:53.650 --> 01:59.320
jidai wa tsui ni atarashii makuake wo mukaeta no sa

01:59.320 --> 02:03.650
Placing this overflowing feelings into this gem

01:59.320 --> 02:03.650
afureta omoi wo kiseki ni komete

02:03.650 --> 02:07.320
And go beyond the future

02:03.650 --> 02:07.320
saki no hou e

02:17.700 --> 02:19.000
Damn it!

02:19.000 --> 02:20.870
We were so close...

02:20.870 --> 02:23.580
Couldn't they spare a few points?

02:23.580 --> 02:27.370
Man... The director's so narrow-minded.

02:27.370 --> 02:29.910
What you meant to say is...

02:29.910 --> 02:31.200
What?

02:31.200 --> 02:33.080
She actually got it right.

02:33.080 --> 02:35.830
I can't believe Lavie actually
sounded intelligent for once...

02:35.830 --> 02:37.120
What?!

02:37.120 --> 02:39.950
Maybe the shock of being expelled
was bigger than we imagined.

02:39.950 --> 02:42.200
Are you feeling all right, Lavie-san?

02:43.870 --> 02:46.910
Ugh! You guys are so mean!

02:46.910 --> 02:48.290
Help me out here, Tia—

02:52.330 --> 02:53.330
Tia...

02:54.830 --> 02:59.040
Huh? Oh, sorry. What was that?

03:01.120 --> 03:03.660
Hey, it's the ladies from the other day.

03:04.700 --> 03:07.330
We really enjoyed
your performance the other day.

03:07.330 --> 03:09.870
When's LiGHTs going to sing again?

03:09.870 --> 03:11.250
Um...

03:11.250 --> 03:12.800
Well...

03:13.120 --> 03:16.830
I'm really sorry. We don't know yet.

03:16.830 --> 03:18.040
Really?

03:19.160 --> 03:22.410
But it'll be sometime soon,
so wait for us, okay?

03:22.410 --> 03:24.330
Okay! I'll look forward to it!

03:25.750 --> 03:27.580
Isn't that great?

03:27.580 --> 03:28.620
Well, goodbye.

03:29.870 --> 03:31.040
See you later!

03:31.040 --> 03:32.620
Yup. See you later.

03:33.540 --> 03:34.910
Tiara...

03:34.910 --> 03:37.160
But LiGHTs is...

03:37.160 --> 03:38.660
I...

03:38.660 --> 03:40.910
I still want to sing.

03:40.910 --> 03:42.500
I understand how you feel, but...

03:43.870 --> 03:45.250
I still...

03:45.250 --> 03:47.200
I still want to be a witch.

03:57.910 --> 04:00.830
That's a really nice carriage.

04:00.830 --> 04:03.040
No way... Why...?

04:04.750 --> 04:06.410
Tia, is that...

04:09.750 --> 04:12.540
We've come for you, Tiara-sama.

04:12.540 --> 04:14.450
Wait, this is your carriage, Tiara?

04:14.450 --> 04:17.040
Wow, you really are a noble.

04:17.040 --> 04:19.370
Tiara-sama is not a noble.

04:24.080 --> 04:25.500
Tia's name is...

04:25.500 --> 04:29.080
Tiara Victoria Lex Waleland.

04:29.080 --> 04:30.660
But isn't that...

04:30.660 --> 04:35.660
She is the daughter of Queen Louise.
The Second Princess of Waleland.

04:35.660 --> 04:37.200
Ehh?!

04:37.200 --> 04:41.700
But Tiara... I mean, Tiara-sama...

04:41.700 --> 04:44.000
I'm sorry I kept it a secret.

04:44.000 --> 04:46.500
Tiara-sama, we must hurry.

04:46.500 --> 04:47.870
But I'm still—

04:47.870 --> 04:51.290
We've been informed that you have been
expelled from Flora Girls Academy.

04:51.290 --> 04:52.910
How did you...

04:52.910 --> 04:56.080
Please wait! Tiara-sama wants to—

04:56.080 --> 04:57.750
Know your place!

04:57.750 --> 04:59.580
If you're going to stand in our way...

04:59.580 --> 05:00.830
Stop!

05:17.410 --> 05:19.580
I'm so sorry, everyone.

05:20.910 --> 05:21.950
Tia...

05:27.200 --> 05:30.200
I can't believe we had
to say goodbye like this...

05:34.700 --> 05:36.540
I just can't accept this!

05:36.540 --> 05:38.200
Wait, Nadeshiko!

05:38.200 --> 05:41.620
Why do Tiara-san and the others
have to be expelled?!

05:41.620 --> 05:43.120
I understand, but...

05:43.120 --> 05:45.410
Those are the academy rules...

05:45.410 --> 05:47.000
I'm going to go object right now!

05:47.000 --> 05:48.370
Onee-chan!

05:48.370 --> 05:49.830
Calm down.

05:49.830 --> 05:52.200
No, I'm going to charge in
the rock and roll way!

05:52.200 --> 05:54.660
I feel the same way you do, but...

05:54.660 --> 05:58.450
I don't think they'll undo
the expulsion even if you go...

06:01.160 --> 06:03.870
Honestly, how unsightly.

06:03.870 --> 06:06.950
But I sorta miss them, too.

06:06.950 --> 06:10.290
I agree with Salsa-sama.

06:10.290 --> 06:12.200
My lady.

06:12.200 --> 06:15.000
Did you want to drink milk that badly?

06:15.000 --> 06:16.660
No, I just...

06:16.660 --> 06:18.580
This is just how I'm feeling right now!

06:18.580 --> 06:22.540
Drinking straight from the creamer...
I must say, you're a trendsetter.

06:22.540 --> 06:26.830
She is? You're amazing, Emilia!

06:33.500 --> 06:35.620
Did you hear, Yue-chin?!

06:35.620 --> 06:37.410
I heard they were expelled.

06:37.410 --> 06:41.370
What a shame! Their Orchestra was lit, too.

06:41.370 --> 06:42.580
Whatever.

06:42.580 --> 06:45.000
It doesn't concern us.

06:45.000 --> 06:47.450
But it really was amazing though.

06:48.500 --> 06:50.450
Hey, it's raining.

06:50.450 --> 06:52.080
We better get inside.

07:00.330 --> 07:02.620
So Tia-chan's a princess...

07:02.620 --> 07:04.370
Don't be rude.

07:04.370 --> 07:07.370
Yes. We need to call her Tiara-sama.

07:07.370 --> 07:09.040
Oh, right.

07:09.040 --> 07:11.660
You knew, right, Rosetta-san?

07:11.660 --> 07:17.120
Yes... But she didn't want any of you
to act unnatural around her.

07:17.120 --> 07:18.660
I see.

07:18.660 --> 07:20.660
But still...

07:20.660 --> 07:25.410
Tia wanted to be our friend
and wanted to belong.

07:26.790 --> 07:29.540
So let's not change anything.

07:34.200 --> 07:36.160
Yeah, you're right.

07:36.160 --> 07:38.370
Tia-chan's always going to be Tia-chan to us!

07:38.370 --> 07:41.500
All right. I won't worry about her title, then.

07:41.500 --> 07:43.500
Tiara's one of us.

07:46.290 --> 07:47.750
Wait...

07:47.750 --> 07:51.120
If Tiara-san is the Second
Princess of Waleland...

07:51.120 --> 07:53.500
Yes. She's Eliza-sama's younger sister.

07:55.910 --> 07:58.040
I guess you really do love Ray...

07:59.450 --> 08:01.330
Ow.

08:00.370 --> 08:01.330
'Sup?

08:01.330 --> 08:03.120
No, it's nothing.

08:03.120 --> 08:05.950
Anyway, the question is
what are we going to do now?

08:05.950 --> 08:08.040
Oh, right.

08:08.040 --> 08:11.000
First, we need to find a place
to stay for the night.

08:11.000 --> 08:14.950
Would it be possible to ask one of
the places you work, Rosetta-san?

08:14.950 --> 08:19.250
That might be difficult. I don't think
they have room for all four of us.

08:21.080 --> 08:23.120
Whatevs. It is what it is.

08:23.120 --> 08:25.410
I guess that means Lavie's
sleeping outdoors tonight.

08:25.410 --> 08:28.830
Wait, why?! Let's go stay at an inn!

08:28.830 --> 08:32.660
We need to save some money since we
don't know what the future holds for us.

08:32.660 --> 08:34.290
Here you go.

08:34.290 --> 08:35.500
Rara-chan.

08:35.500 --> 08:37.330
But we didn't order this.

08:37.330 --> 08:41.700
It's my treat. LiGHTs' Orchestra
was totally awesome!

08:41.700 --> 08:42.750
Yay.

08:42.750 --> 08:43.830
Thank you.

08:43.830 --> 08:44.910
Don't mind if I do.

08:44.910 --> 08:46.290
It looks delicious.

08:46.290 --> 08:48.500
I'm glad you guys seem okay, though.

08:48.500 --> 08:50.910
Both Champe and Mary
were pretty worried, too.

08:50.910 --> 08:53.250
We can't stay depressed forever.

08:53.250 --> 08:54.830
That's the spirit!

08:54.830 --> 08:56.580
So where's Tiara?

08:56.580 --> 08:58.500
I haven't seen her around.

08:58.500 --> 09:00.080
Well...

09:00.080 --> 09:01.450
We'll tell you later.

09:01.450 --> 09:04.750
Yes... We can't really say here.

09:04.750 --> 09:08.870
Oh, hey, Ratura. Do you know
a place we can spend the night?

09:08.870 --> 09:12.120
Somewhere to spend the night?
Why not right here?

09:12.120 --> 09:13.160
Here?

09:13.160 --> 09:15.370
There's some space upstairs.

09:15.370 --> 09:16.950
Want me to ask for you?

09:16.950 --> 09:18.200
Are you sure?

09:18.200 --> 09:19.870
Sure, fanks!

09:19.870 --> 09:21.040
Okay, one sec.

09:22.580 --> 09:25.160
If they'll let us stay here— Ow...

09:26.040 --> 09:28.330
We'll be set for a while.

09:28.330 --> 09:29.870
Yes.

09:29.870 --> 09:33.250
Hey! You ready for the Cester Festival yet?

09:34.120 --> 09:37.870
We're getting there.
They're supposed to go all out this year,

09:37.870 --> 09:39.210
so we've got our work cut out for us.

09:39.210 --> 09:41.200
Well, we've been waiting for this festival.

09:41.200 --> 09:44.540
Hopefully the weather doesn't
turn out like today though.

09:44.540 --> 09:48.000
Oh, right. The Cester Festival is coming up.

09:48.000 --> 09:51.000
We just got to eat and have fun
last year. It was great.

09:51.000 --> 09:52.700
A festival, huh...

09:52.700 --> 09:55.660
I'm not excited at all for some reason.

09:55.660 --> 09:57.330
Yes...

09:57.330 --> 09:59.410
Sorry to keep you guys waiting.

09:59.410 --> 10:00.750
They said okay!

10:00.750 --> 10:02.200
Thank you very much.
Yes!

10:02.200 --> 10:04.580
Now we won't have to sleep outside.

10:04.580 --> 10:05.790
There is a condition!

10:05.790 --> 10:08.700
You guys have to help out at the shop.

10:12.250 --> 10:14.040
Thank you for waiting.

10:14.040 --> 10:16.290
Here's your Nilgiri tea with lemon.

10:18.330 --> 10:20.750
Are you ready to order?

10:20.750 --> 10:24.080
May I get the Juicy Steak medium rare?

10:24.080 --> 10:27.410
I'd like the broccoli salad.
Oh, and some iced coffee.

10:27.410 --> 10:30.790
Would you like your coffee hot or cold?

10:39.660 --> 10:41.790
Ow...

10:41.790 --> 10:43.200
Ashley-san?

10:43.200 --> 10:45.040
No, it's nothing.

10:50.500 --> 10:52.330
That was a close one.

10:52.330 --> 10:54.330
Sorry about that. Thanks.

10:54.330 --> 10:55.370
Not a problem.

10:55.370 --> 10:56.830
Order coming in!

10:56.830 --> 11:00.120
I need a janky steak at minimum
rare and a bukkololi salad!

11:00.790 --> 11:02.700
Oh, and a hot iced coffee.

11:10.910 --> 11:13.200
Working is so hard...

11:13.200 --> 11:17.040
It's not so bad once you get used to it.
It can actually be pretty fun.

11:17.040 --> 11:18.660
You're amazing, Rosetta.

11:18.660 --> 11:21.120
I had a lot of fun, too.

11:21.120 --> 11:24.040
Yeah, and the owner said to
never let you take orders again.

11:24.040 --> 11:25.040
Why?!

11:25.040 --> 11:26.700
You kept messing up.

11:26.700 --> 11:28.580
Well, you broke a plate, Ashley!

11:28.580 --> 11:30.290
B-But that was your fault!

11:30.290 --> 11:31.790
Don't lift the blame on me!

11:31.790 --> 11:34.160
You mean "shift the blame"!

11:35.410 --> 11:36.500
Can I say something?

11:36.500 --> 11:37.830
What?!

11:37.830 --> 11:40.660
About what we're going to do now...

11:40.660 --> 11:43.790
Yes, we do need to think about that.

11:43.790 --> 11:45.910
Can't we just keep doing this?

11:45.910 --> 11:48.410
We don't actually live here, remember?

11:48.410 --> 11:51.200
We can't just stay here forever...

11:52.450 --> 11:55.040
About that...

11:55.040 --> 11:58.000
I'm thinking about going home for a bit.

11:58.000 --> 12:00.080
Ueh?!

12:00.080 --> 12:04.200
I need to report back home since
I can't stay at the academy anymore.

12:04.200 --> 12:05.580
I see.

12:05.580 --> 12:07.290
You're leaving, too, Rose-chan?

12:07.290 --> 12:10.040
It's going to get really lonely.

12:10.040 --> 12:13.370
Well, I'm not leaving right away.

12:13.370 --> 12:16.370
I plan to stay in Malmcester
for three or four more days.

12:19.080 --> 12:21.870
Then let's have a going away party!

12:21.870 --> 12:25.080
Yeah, we should! Let's have a feast!

12:25.080 --> 12:26.620
We can't go all out though.

12:26.620 --> 12:28.830
Boo. Ashley, you party pooper.

12:28.830 --> 12:30.500
I don't see why not.

12:30.500 --> 12:32.290
Let's do this!

12:32.290 --> 12:34.790
Not you, too, Lynette.

12:34.790 --> 12:37.910
Well, I'm sure you're all tired.
Let's get some sleep.

12:37.910 --> 12:39.870
Lyn-chan, You can use the bed.

12:39.870 --> 12:41.410
Wait, are you sure?

12:41.410 --> 12:43.330
You seem the most exhausted.

12:52.870 --> 12:54.000
What happened there?

12:55.910 --> 13:00.450
That's Leskarka. They were attacked by
a horde of Magical Monsters the other day.

13:00.450 --> 13:01.950
A horde of Magical Monsters?

13:01.950 --> 13:05.330
Yes. We are looking after
some of the evacuees in Bristol.

13:22.450 --> 13:24.160
That looks like it hurts.

13:24.160 --> 13:26.250
Are you okay?

13:26.250 --> 13:29.000
Look at your cute, little, rosy cheek!

13:29.000 --> 13:31.250
Shut up, Silly Rabbit! Ow...

13:32.410 --> 13:35.080
What can we do to help?

13:35.080 --> 13:38.450
I'm sure it'll get better if you
rub some red peppers on there.

13:38.450 --> 13:40.160
Are you trying to kill me?

13:40.160 --> 13:42.870
If only one of us could use Healing Magic...

13:44.250 --> 13:47.410
Maybe Angelica-san can heal it.

13:47.410 --> 13:49.000
Angelica?

13:49.000 --> 13:52.500
She healed Coco-san
at our bump ball tournament.

13:52.500 --> 13:54.580
Oh, you're right.

13:58.500 --> 14:00.450
Now we're all set.

14:00.450 --> 14:02.540
Hmph. You weakling.

14:02.540 --> 14:04.500
I know, right?

14:04.500 --> 14:06.580
Yeah, this isn't gonna work.

14:06.580 --> 14:08.950
Magic doesn't work on wisdom teeth.

14:08.950 --> 14:10.700
Fwat?!

14:10.700 --> 14:12.790
Then what should we do?

14:12.790 --> 14:16.620
Time to go to the teeth yankers.

14:16.620 --> 14:17.950
Teeth yankers?

14:21.540 --> 14:23.330
Hiyah!

14:30.000 --> 14:32.160
This is the end.

14:39.660 --> 14:41.250
Just kill me now.

14:43.500 --> 14:47.000
Well, I mean, at least they got the tooth out.

14:47.000 --> 14:50.580
Yes. I'm amazed you survived that.

14:50.580 --> 14:53.250
Just get some rest for a while.

14:53.250 --> 14:55.660
What are you guys even doing?

14:57.080 --> 14:58.330
What do you mean?

14:58.330 --> 14:59.950
We're working at the café
and spending the nights the—

14:59.950 --> 15:01.660
You're satisfied with that?

15:03.370 --> 15:06.080
Well, what are we supposed to do?

15:06.080 --> 15:08.160
Tiara-san's not here, either.

15:08.160 --> 15:14.330
Hmph. Don't bother, Angelica.
No point in talking to these laggards.

15:14.330 --> 15:16.750
What...?

15:16.750 --> 15:17.910
Ashley...

15:17.910 --> 15:19.330
Don't push yourself.

15:19.330 --> 15:23.500
I don't have time to be
depressed over a tooth or two.

15:23.500 --> 15:25.830
What? You've got a problem?

15:25.830 --> 15:29.250
We gave it all we had.

15:30.370 --> 15:32.750
We regret nothing.

15:32.750 --> 15:35.750
Yeah! We did our best!

15:35.750 --> 15:39.330
True, your Orchestra wasn't half bad.

15:40.330 --> 15:45.000
But you're willing to let this be game over
just because you got expelled?

15:45.000 --> 15:49.410
What's important right now
is what you guys want to do.

15:50.250 --> 15:53.290
It's fine to be content and all,

15:53.290 --> 15:56.330
but eventually, you're just going to get lazy.

15:56.330 --> 15:58.120
Angelica-san...

15:58.120 --> 16:00.160
Let's go, Angelica.

16:00.160 --> 16:03.160
Well, do your best not to die at least.

16:14.620 --> 16:16.500
I'll be going now.

16:16.500 --> 16:18.160
It's going to get even lonelier now.

16:18.160 --> 16:21.540
You still have time until the night carriage...

16:21.540 --> 16:25.160
Well, I need to tell all
the places I worked at thanks.

16:25.160 --> 16:27.160
You don't have to go today.

16:28.790 --> 16:31.250
We haven't even had the going away party yet...

16:31.250 --> 16:36.080
After Angelica and Lucifer talked to us,
I decided to think about everything myself.

16:36.080 --> 16:39.910
I decided I needed to go now.

16:39.910 --> 16:41.000
Why?

16:41.000 --> 16:42.750
I'm worried about Tia.

16:42.750 --> 16:45.040
In that case—
I'm worried about her, too!

16:45.040 --> 16:48.540
But where I'm going isn't that close.

16:50.040 --> 16:52.500
That's true, but...

16:52.500 --> 16:55.580
My home is nearby, so leave it to me.

16:58.080 --> 16:59.870
All right.

16:59.870 --> 17:03.200
Please look after Tiara-san for us.

17:03.200 --> 17:05.580
Lynette...

17:05.580 --> 17:08.410
Let's see each other again soon.

17:15.410 --> 17:18.450
You said you'd stay with me forever...

17:18.450 --> 17:21.660
Sir, we're closed for the night.

17:21.660 --> 17:23.290
You said forever!

17:25.790 --> 17:29.660
Did you just need an excuse
to leave your village?!

17:35.620 --> 17:37.290
Thank you very much.

17:37.290 --> 17:38.910
Let's get this over with.

17:38.910 --> 17:40.000
Yes.

17:40.000 --> 17:41.750
Oh, there you are.

17:41.750 --> 17:45.160
I guess it was true that
you guys were working here.

17:45.160 --> 17:47.450
Well, they're letting us stay here, so...

17:47.450 --> 17:49.750
What brings you all here?

17:49.750 --> 17:53.290
We were worried about you
since we heard you were expelled.

17:53.290 --> 17:55.540
I'm glad you're doing okay.

17:55.540 --> 17:57.870
Ashley, what happened to your face?

17:57.870 --> 17:59.870
Don't ask.

18:00.750 --> 18:03.250
Where're Rosetta-san and Tiara-san?

18:03.250 --> 18:05.700
They're...

18:05.700 --> 18:07.700
What are you doing?

18:07.700 --> 18:09.450
Just go chat upstairs.

18:09.450 --> 18:10.410
But...

18:10.410 --> 18:12.620
I'll take care of that.

18:13.870 --> 18:15.330
Thank you very much.

18:17.790 --> 18:20.540
I had no idea all that happened.

18:20.540 --> 18:24.700
But wow. Tiara's a princess?
Talk about a shocker.

18:24.700 --> 18:26.330
Lily, that's rude.

18:26.330 --> 18:27.330
Whoops.

18:27.330 --> 18:29.160
No, it's fine.

18:29.160 --> 18:34.410
Tiara-san wanted us to treat her
like a friend, not a princess.

18:34.410 --> 18:36.500
That sounds like Tiara-san.

18:36.500 --> 18:40.200
I guess that means we won't be able
to see you perform an Orchestra again...

18:40.200 --> 18:41.830
Wait, you saw it?

18:41.830 --> 18:43.120
It was awesome!

18:43.120 --> 18:45.160
It was very lovely.

18:45.160 --> 18:49.080
We've been in a slump lately.

18:49.080 --> 18:52.620
But seeing your Orchestra
really motivated us.

18:52.620 --> 18:54.950
We decided to give it another shot.

18:54.950 --> 18:56.910
—Thank you.
—Thank you very much.

18:56.910 --> 18:58.580
Aw, you're making me blush.

18:58.580 --> 19:01.040
We're happy to hear that.

19:01.040 --> 19:03.870
I'm sure Tiara would be happy to hear that.

19:03.870 --> 19:06.040
So what are you guys going to do now?

19:06.040 --> 19:08.790
We were actually just thinking about that.

19:08.790 --> 19:11.830
I'm not sure why you sound
so proud about that.

19:11.830 --> 19:14.040
Our dreams of becoming witches are now...

19:14.040 --> 19:16.160
Dreams aren't everything.

19:17.790 --> 19:20.870
At least, that's what I thought.

19:20.870 --> 19:26.000
I was sort of forced to go to this school, too.

19:26.000 --> 19:30.580
But after we met Melissa and started
spending our days as a group,

19:30.580 --> 19:34.370
our bond became my treasure.

19:34.370 --> 19:38.620
My dream now is to protect this bond.

19:38.620 --> 19:39.750
Coco...

19:39.750 --> 19:43.750
So I'm sure you'll all have
new encounters and dreams.

19:43.750 --> 19:44.870
But...

19:44.870 --> 19:49.700
The days the five of us spent
together are irreplaceable.

19:49.700 --> 19:53.580
We all worked so hard
and put on that Orchestra together.

19:53.580 --> 19:55.370
This can't be the end...

19:56.870 --> 19:58.750
I won't accept it.

19:58.750 --> 20:00.660
Lavie-san...

20:00.660 --> 20:02.290
Well, I mean!

20:02.290 --> 20:04.500
The five of us are LiGHTs, right?

20:04.500 --> 20:07.370
I don't want to be a trio now!

20:07.370 --> 20:10.410
I mean... I feel the same way.

20:11.450 --> 20:15.040
I want Tia-chan and Rose-chan to be with us, too.

20:15.040 --> 20:17.370
That's all I want right now.

20:17.370 --> 20:19.580
But...

20:19.580 --> 20:20.580
Um...

20:20.580 --> 20:24.830
We all want the five of us
to be together, right?

20:26.250 --> 20:29.450
Tiara-san and Rosetta-san
are headed to Bristol right now.

20:29.450 --> 20:32.250
Then there's just one thing for us to do.

20:33.580 --> 20:36.000
Yeah... Yeah, you're right, Lyn-chan!

20:36.000 --> 20:38.330
Why didn't we think of that sooner?

20:38.330 --> 20:40.500
Right?

20:40.500 --> 20:41.870
Ashley!

20:41.870 --> 20:43.290
Yeah, let's go!

20:43.290 --> 20:46.200
Wait! Are you actually
planning to go to Bristol?

20:48.040 --> 20:50.450
But what are you going to do
once you're there?

20:50.450 --> 20:52.870
We'll figure all that out later!

20:52.870 --> 20:53.950
But...

20:53.950 --> 20:56.700
I think that's fine.
You said so yourself earlier.

20:56.700 --> 20:58.950
That a bond is a treasure.

20:58.950 --> 21:01.370
And treasures are precious.

21:01.370 --> 21:02.830
Not to mention...

21:02.830 --> 21:05.190
I mean, we only got expelled.

21:04.620 --> 21:06.350
I don't think we're going
to be able to stop them.

21:05.190 --> 21:07.750
Let's do what we think is best for us!

21:07.750 --> 21:10.450
Tomorrow's more important
than today anyway.

21:10.450 --> 21:13.040
I'm pretty sure today is important, too...

21:13.040 --> 21:16.580
Make sure you show us
your Orchestra again someday.

21:16.580 --> 21:17.620
Of course!

21:17.620 --> 21:18.950
We promise!

21:30.540 --> 21:34.120
Hey there, miss.
Do you mind being our guide?

21:40.000 --> 21:42.200
What are you all doing here?

21:42.200 --> 21:44.080
We'll go with you!

21:44.080 --> 21:46.000
To go get Tia-chan!

21:46.000 --> 21:47.910
Eh? Get Tia?

21:47.910 --> 21:49.410
Don't even worry about it.

21:49.410 --> 21:52.370
We can't let ourselves be separated!

21:52.370 --> 21:54.290
We'll tell you the details along the way.

21:56.580 --> 21:59.450
Okay! Let's go, sir.

21:59.450 --> 22:00.500
You've got it.

22:04.950 --> 22:06.950
To Bristol!

22:20.880 --> 22:30.780
mado no soto wa yasashii tsukiakari sotto

22:20.880 --> 22:30.780
Outside the window, the gentle moonlight is shining softly

22:30.780 --> 22:39.480
akari keshite yume no hashi wo watarou

22:30.780 --> 22:39.480
Put out the lights and cross the bridge of dreams

22:39.480 --> 22:44.280
kie soude kienai hikari ga ima

22:39.480 --> 22:44.280
The weakening yet everlasting light is now

22:44.280 --> 22:49.080
mabuta no mukou no sekai ni hirogatta

22:44.280 --> 22:49.080
Spreading out into the world behind my eyelids

22:49.080 --> 22:51.780
ironna omoi ga afurete

22:49.080 --> 22:51.780
Various feelings are overflowing

22:51.780 --> 22:55.530
kirakira mabushiku kagayaiteru

22:51.780 --> 22:55.530
sparklingly and dazzlingly shining

22:55.530 --> 22:58.680
zutto

22:55.530 --> 22:58.680
Forever

22:58.680 --> 23:00.780
It's shining stars

23:00.780 --> 23:05.580
ashita wa donna hi ni naru kana

23:00.780 --> 23:05.580
I wonder what kind of day tomorrow will be

23:05.580 --> 23:10.680
kokoro ni utsushidasu keshiki wa

23:05.580 --> 23:10.680
The scenery that is reflected in my heart

23:10.680 --> 23:15.630
kitai namida yume no zenbu ga kasanatta

23:10.680 --> 23:15.630
Expectations, tears, and dreams, all of it bottled up in my heart

23:15.630 --> 23:19.230
watashi no planetarium

23:15.630 --> 23:19.230
My planetarium

23:19.230 --> 23:19.980
hora

23:19.230 --> 23:25.080
Look, in that star that is shining the brightest

23:19.980 --> 23:25.080
ichiban kagayaiteiru ano hoshi ni

23:25.080 --> 23:29.280
negai kakete oyasumi

23:25.080 --> 23:29.280
A wish is enclosed: "Good night"
